1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:01,235
Hi friends!

2
00:00:01,235 --> 00:00:02,103
I'm Mimzi,

3
00:00:02,103 --> 00:00:03,506
and this is Teddy!

4
00:00:04,056 --> 00:00:04,963
Hello!

5
00:00:05,513 --> 00:00:07,652
Let's dive under the sea!

6
00:00:07,652 --> 00:00:08,416
Splash!

7
00:00:09,766 --> 00:00:11,695
Look! It's a fish.

8
00:00:12,195 --> 00:00:13,182
Fish!

9
00:00:13,732 --> 00:00:16,542
The fish swims with its little fins.

10
00:00:17,892 --> 00:00:19,606
Who is this?

11
00:00:21,406 --> 00:00:23,402
It's a dolphin!

12
00:00:23,952 --> 00:00:26,047
What does the dolphin say?

13
00:00:27,447 --> 00:00:29,080
Click, click, squeak!

14
00:00:29,630 --> 00:00:32,535
The dolphin loves to jump and play.

15
00:00:33,885 --> 00:00:36,004
Look! It's a turtle.

16
00:00:36,504 --> 00:00:37,653
Turtle!

17
00:00:38,203 --> 00:00:40,561
The turtle has a hard shell.

18
00:00:41,911 --> 00:00:43,934
Look! It's a whale.

19
00:00:44,434 --> 00:00:45,483
Whale!

20
00:00:46,033 --> 00:00:48,676
The whale is very, very big.

21
00:00:50,026 --> 00:00:51,740
Who is this?

22
00:00:53,540 --> 00:00:55,173
It's a crab!

23
00:00:55,723 --> 00:00:57,741
The crab walks sideways.

24
00:00:57,741 --> 00:00:58,937
Pinch, pinch!

25
00:01:00,287 --> 00:01:02,525
Look! It's an octopus.

26
00:01:03,025 --> 00:01:04,336
Octopus!

27
00:01:04,886 --> 00:01:07,362
The octopus has eight arms!

28
00:01:08,712 --> 00:01:11,333
Bye bye, ocean friends!

29
00:01:11,883 --> 00:01:14,121
Great job, little learner!

30
00:01:14,671 --> 00:01:16,559
Share Mimzi with a friend,

31
00:01:16,559 --> 00:01:19,099
and subscribe for more learning fun!

32
00:01:19,649 --> 00:01:20,646
Next time,

33
00:01:20,646 --> 00:01:22,794
let's learn yummy fruits.

34
00:01:23,044 --> 00:01:24,415
Bye bye!
